  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s1" vid="1CH 25:31">Olekatakɔ N-yoko Banyuntɛ<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Nnya mmle baasɛ ni n-yoko banyuntɛ nwu di akudi kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 26:1">Di Kora batii kamɛ: Kore obisuɔtɔbi Meselemia, aale ni Asaf babisuɔtɔbi onwii lɛma.<verse eid="1CH 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Meselemia lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:2">Sakaria niale obi kasale,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:2">Yediael ɔnyɔɔfa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:2">Sebadia otiɛfa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:2">Yarniel ɔnaafa,<verse eid="1CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Elam ɔnɔnle,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:3">Yehohanan okuɔnle</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:3">Eliehoenai kafɔɔ okuɛnsinle.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Obed-Edom kafɔɔ lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:4">Semaia niale obi kasale,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:4">Yehosabad ɔnyɔɔfa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:4">Yoah otiɛfa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:4">Sakar ɔnaafa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:4">Netanel ɔnɔnle,<verse eid="1CH 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />Amiel okuɔnle,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:5">Isakar okuɛnsinle</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:5">Peuletai kafɔɔ ɔnɛnle.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CH 26:5">(Diekye Yaa lata Obed-Edom lɛtɔtrɔ.)<verse eid="1CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Semaia kafɔɔ lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi ba niale ni batunletɛ di ote lɛma leyo kamɛ, diekye batii ba niatɛ baawo ni baale. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Semaia babisuɔtɔbi niale: Otni, Refael, Obed ku Elsabad; banantii nɔɔ Elihu ku Semakia kafɔɔ lale batii ba niawo nii. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Mba mmle bamuu lale Obed-Edom banantii; mma ku babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ku banantii lɛma lale batii ba niawo nii, baawɛ osie kafɔɔ baata ni ɔkpɛ nwu ɔbla- Obed-Edom banantii bamuu labla, afosi-akuɔ-banyɔ.<verse eid="1CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Meselemia lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi ku banantii, baale ni basuɔtɔ niawo nii- bamuu labla lefosi-banɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Merari otii nwu Hosa lawɛ babisuɔtɔbi: Simri niale ɔkasale (kuntɛ ditale nnwɔɔ niale lelofo kasale yi, ote ladiki nwɔ aale ɔkasale), <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Hilkia ɔnyɔɔfa, Tebalia otiɛfa, Sakaria kafɔɔ ɔnaafa. Hosa babisuɔtɔbi ku banantii bamuu labla lefosi-batiɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />N-yoko banyuntɛ ba mmle baasɛ ni, diafe ni di banɔɔfo lɛma suoto, lawɛ sɛkpɛ baata kasumu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, fɛ mmle okle di banantii lɛma lawɛ nii. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Baawii atrebi baata kayoko biala, di ayo lɛma kanya, babisɔ ku banɔɔfo kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Kufĩkatunkɔ Kayoko atrebi owii nwu lase di Selemia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leyooto le mmle yi, nninwu ninle Meselemia nɛ</char></note> suoto. Ninfɛ baawii atrebi baata obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Sakaria wɔ niale ni numbentɛ anta ni batii kɔkà, ni di Katookasɔ Kayoko atrebi owii nwu lase di suoto nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Kalakasɔ Kayoko atrebi owii nwu lase di Obed-Edom suoto, ni di asaakatɛkɔ atrebi owii nwu lase di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Kufĩkamɛɛkɔ Kayoko atrebi owii nwu ku Saleket Kayoko di katoo lɛkyɛ osuku lase di Supim ku Hosa suoto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:16">Nyuntɛ biala ɔkpɛ lakyɛkyɛ ku nyuntɛ wo nɔɔ ole: <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Lewi batii bakuɔ niawɛ di kufĩkatunkɔ Kayoko dii biala, bana di katookasɔ dii biala, bana di kalakasɔ dii biala, banyɔ, banyɔ kafɔɔ di asaakatɛkɔ n-yoko nwu. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ yi, bana lawɛ di osuku, ni di banyɔ lawɛ di kaflɔnkɔ nwu kamu nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Mba mmle niale n-yoko banyuntɛ akudi ya niale ni Kora ku Merari banantii nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Sɛkpɛ Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Lewi batii wo lɛma niayila di Yaa leyo kotontɛkɔ ku asaa ya baakleklesa ni asaantɛkɔ kanya.<verse eid="1CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Ladan banantii ba niale ni Gerson batii diafe ni di Ladan suoto ku mba niale ni Gerson otii nwu Ladan ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo, niale Yehieli nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Yehieli babisuɔtɔbi niale, Setam ku obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Yoel nɛ. Mma niayila di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kotontɛkɔ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Di Amram batii kamɛ, Yishar batii, Hebron batii ku Usiel batii.<verse eid="1CH 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Mose obisuɔtɔbi Gersom ɔnantii, Sebuel niale ɔnɔɔfotii wɔ niayila ni di kotontɛkɔ nwu kanya nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Banantii nɔɔ diafe ni di Eliesa suoto niale: obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Rehabia, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yesaia, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yoram, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Sikri ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Selomit. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Selomit ku banantii nɔɔ niayila di kotontɛkɔ nnya mmuu di asaa ya di Ɔka Dawid, ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo ba niale ni bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ di nkpe ku alafa kanya, ku bakpɛtɛ bamba kanyabayilatɛ lakleklesa ni nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Baakleklesa kakpɛ kamɛ asaa ya awo baayɔ ni di kakpɛ kamɛ baata SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ololaa. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Ni baayɔ lɛsaa biala le di asaanyatɛ, Samuel ku Kis obisuɔtɔbi Ɔka Saul, Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner ku Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab lakleklesa ni, ku asaa bamba ya amuu baakleklesa ni baakpee di Selomit ku banantii nɔɔ nnɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewi Batii Bamba Sɛkpɛ</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Di Yishar batii kamɛ yi: Sɛkpɛ se baata ni Kenania ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ditale olekatakɔ ɔkpɛ, mma niale banɔɔfotii ku bakantɛ di Israel suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Di Hebron batii kamɛ yi: Hasabia ku banantii nɔɔ- basuɔtɔ sientɛ kakpe-alafa-akuɛnsĩ. Mma niayila kaanya di Israel, di Yordan kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ baatɔɔbla SAATE nwu kasumu ku ɔka sɛkpɛ simuu nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Hebron batii mma yi, Yeria niale ma ɔka di ayo lɛma kamɛ ayooto kanya. Ni di Dawid sɛka olebee di alɛɛ afosi-ana kamɛ, baawolaa akũ kamɛ, ni baawɛ basuɔtɔ sientɛ di Hebron batii kamɛ di Yaser di Gilead nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Yeria lawɛ banantii nkpe-nnyɔ-alafa-akuɛnsĩ, baale ni basuɔtɔ sientɛ ku ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo, ni di Ɔka Dawid layɔ ma aase di Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manase-kɔna kakyɛ kanya aata ɔlaa biala niɛkaako ni Yaa ku ɔka sɛsaabla nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bakpɛtɛ Ku Abaa Sɛkpɛ Bablatɛ Dikudi Ose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Nnya Israel batii- di ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo, nkpe kanyabayilatɛ ku alafa kanyabayilatɛ ku banɔɔfotii lɛma, mba niabla ni ɔka ɔkpɛ di asaa ya amuu niakaako ni bakpɛtɛ akudi nwu niatɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ di kɔwɛntɛ biala di lɛlɛɛ nimuu kamɛ. Dikudi biala labla bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Mba niayila ni di dikudi kasale kanya, baata ni kɔwɛntɛ kasale niale, Sabdiel obisuɔtɔbi Yasobeam. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Peres ɔnantii aale ku bakpɛtɛ bamuu banɔɔfotii ɔka aale di kɔwɛntɛ kasale.<verse eid="1CH 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Ahohi otii nwu Dodai niayila di kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa dikudi kanya; Miklot niayila di dikudi nɔɔ kanya. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Bakpɛtɛ dikudi tiɛfa kanyayilatɛ, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa niale oletatɛ Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia. Bakpɛtɛ ɔka aale, di bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna lawɛ ni di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Benaia wɔ mmle niale kpɛtɛ sientɛ di bakpɛtɛ Afosi-atiɛ nwu kamɛ, ni aayila kafɔɔ di bakpɛtɛ sientɛ nwu Afosi-atiɛ kanya nɛ. Obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Amisabad niayila di dikudi nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="1CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Ɔnaafa, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ naafa, niale Yoab obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Asahel; obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Sebadia niayila nwɔ kaanya di kakpimaa nɔɔ. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Ɔnɔnle, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ nɔɔnle, niale Yisrah otii nwu kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Samhut nɛ. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Okuɔnle, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ kuɔnle, niale Tekoa otii nwu Ikes obisuɔtɔbi Ira. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Okuɛnsinle, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle, niale Pelon otii nwu Heles, aale ni Efraim otii. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Ɔnɛnle, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ nɛnle, niale Husa otii nwu Sibekai, aakye ni Serah. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Ɔnansinle, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ nansinle, niale Anatot otii nwu Abieser, aale ni Benyamin otii. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Ofosile, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ fosile, niale Netofat otii nwu Maharai, aale ni Serah otii. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Lefosi ɔkasale, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ lefosi- kɔkasale, niale Piraton otii nwu Benaia, aale ni Efraim otii. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Lefosi ɔnyɔɔfa, diata ni kɔwɛntɛ lefosi-kɔnyɔɔfa, niale Netofat otii nwu Heldai, aakye ni Otniel leyo kamɛ. Bakpɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anyɔ-nkpe-nna niawɛ di dikudi nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ana Banɔɔfotii</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Banɔɔfotii ba niayila ni di Israel ana kanya niale:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 27:16" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:16">di Ruben batii suoto; Sikri Obisuɔtɔbi Eliesa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:16">di Simeon batii suoto:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:16">Maaka obisuɔtɔbi Sefatia;<verse eid="1CH 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />di Lewi suoto: Kemuel obisuɔtɔbi Hasabia;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:17">di Aron suoto: Sadok;<verse eid="1CH 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />di Yuda suoto: Elihu, Dawid obilɛma-suɔtɔbi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:18">di Isakar suoto: Mikael obisuɔtɔbi Omri;<verse eid="1CH 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />di Sebulun suoto: Obadia obisuɔtɔbi Yismaia;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:19">di Naftali suoto: Asriel obisuɔtɔbi Yerimot;<verse eid="1CH 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />di Efraim batii suoto: Asasia obisuɔtɔbi Hosea;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:20">di Manase kɔna kakyɛ suoto: Pedaia obisuɔtɔbi Yoel;<verse eid="1CH 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />di Manase kɔna-kakyɛ ka ninkpe ni di Gelead suoto niale: Sakaria obisuɔtɔbi Ido nɛ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CH 27:21">di Benyamin suoto: Abner obisuɔtɔbi Yaasiel;<verse eid="1CH 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />di Dan suoto: Yeroham obisuɔtɔbi Asarel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Mba mmle niale banɔɔfotii di Israel ana suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Dawid ditaka basuɔtɔ ba niafũ ni alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ diawa ni kasɔ, diekye SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata Israel batii mpɔ kpinwu fɛ awɛntrɛbi di kolo. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab lakyekasɔ aatɔɔka basuɔtɔ kafɔɔ ataloo. Yaa ɔblɔ yakayaka lawa di Israel suoto ta batii ɔka nwu oso, ni batakpana lɛpɔ lɛma baakpee di Ɔka Dawid sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Lɛsaawɛ Banyuntɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Adiel obisuɔtɔbi Asmawet niayila di ɔka leyo asaantɛkɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:25">Usia obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan niayila di kale akudi kɔkyɛɛ asaantɛkɔ kanya, di sekpoo, sekpoenyii ku ayo takale ya di banyuntɛ nsiɛ ni kamɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Kelub obisuɔtɔbi Esri niayila di bakpɛntɛ ba ninkpɛ ni afe di kasɔ nwu suoto kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Ramat otii nwu Simei niayila di nta awosobi afe kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:27">Sifim otii nwu Sabdi niayila kaanya diata awosobi nta nsekɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Geder otii nwu Baal-Hanan niayila di nnɔnyi awoso ku abue awoso di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ akpenkpe nkpaa kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:28">Yoas niayila di awosobi nnɔnyi ɔkpɛ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Saron otii nwu Sitra niayila di base-bɔkɛɛ kplɛ ba niatoowee ni sɛfa di Saron kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:29">Adlai obisuɔtɔbi Safat niayila di base-bɔkɛɛ kplɛ ba niawɛ ni di sɛtaata kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Ismael otii nwu Obil niayila di kapu bapɔnkɔ kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:30">Meronot otii nwu Yehedia niayila di bapɔnkɔ ba nintuka ni atoo kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Hagri otii nwu Yasis niayila di babɔkɛɛ sele kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:31">Mba mmle bamuu niale banɔɔfotii ba niayila ni di Ɔka Dawid lɛsaawɛ kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Ba Niatɔɔta Ni Dawid Kɔkà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Dawid ote bisɔnle Yonatan lale otii wɔ ninta ni kɔkã, otii wɔ niatofo ni lɛsaa, aatofo ni kukũ kafɔɔ. Hakmoni obisuɔtɔbi Yehiel niatoonyu ɔka babisuɔtɔbi nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Ahitofel niale otii wɔ ninkà ni ɔka nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:33">Arki otii nwu Husai niale ɔka siɛwo nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Benaia obisuɔtɔbi Yehoiada ku Abiatar nfɛ niatɔɔta ɔka kɔkà di Ahitofel sɛmaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:34">Yoab niale bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ di ɔka leyo nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Latuo Mmle Babatofo Ni Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Dawid lalɛɛ Israel banɔɔfotii bamuu aasiisa di Yerusalem: banɔɔfotii di ana nwu kanya, bakpɛtɛ akudi kanyabayilatɛ ba nimbla ni ɔka sɛkpɛ, bakpɛtɛ nkpe kanyabayilatɛ ku bakpɛtɛ alafa kanyabayilatɛ, banɔɔfotii ba niayila ni di lɛsaawɛ nimuu ku babɔkɛɛ sele ba niale ni ɔka ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bale kanya, diakyakaa ni di lɛkayo banɔɔfotii, basuɔtɔ sientɛ ku bakpɛtɛ ba niawɛ ni sɛkambi bamuu.<verse eid="1CH 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Ni di Ɔka Dawid lataka aayila ninkpaa nɔɔ suoto aabuɛ alɛ: “Bikyɔɔ mi atoko, babiloo ku batii nii. Diasiɛ mi di otu nlɛ katofo leyo fɛ ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ nta SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa, nta Yaa loo nkpaa ditikasaa, ni labla disibu nlɛ kotofo ni nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Kafɔɔ Yaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ, ‘Diele afɔ nimatofo leyo fanta Leyooto nii, diekye kpɛtɛ fale, fatoowii ni ntɔ kafɔɔ.’<verse eid="1CH 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />“Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu, Israel Yaa lediki mi di leyo nii nimuu kamɛ alɛ nle ɔka di Israel omuu suoto dinaa ni kaloo. Eediki Yuda fɛ tunletɛ, ni eediki leyo nii kamɛ kafɔɔ eekyeko Yuda leyo kamɛ nɛ, ni di teemi babisuɔtɔbi kamɛ kafɔɔ yi, lebuo nwɔ anu ni eese mi sɛka di Israel omuu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Di babisuɔtɔbi nii bamuu kamɛ- di SAATE nwu kafɔɔ latɛɛ ni kpinwu yi- atoodiki obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon alɛ asiɛ di SAATE nwu sɛka kalekɔ lɛkakpomii di Israel suoto. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />Aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: ‘Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Solomon ninle nnwɔ nimatofo ni leyo nii ku nflɔnkɔ nii nɛ, diekye ntodiki nwɔ nlɛ ale mi obisuɔtɔbi, ni ami kafɔɔ kamale nwɔ kote. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Kamase sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo nse aakyi di sɛsaabla nii ku afiofa nii sɛmaa, fɛ mmle bɔɔbla ni di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ.’<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Nioso kanunua kɔta ye mintofo di Israel omuu, ku SAATE nwu kasiisakɔ anu, di Yaa loo kafɔɔ konu ni nlɛ: Bilolaabinyu bietikanko SAATE nwu Yaa lee afiofa amuu, alɛ biayɔ kasɔ biene ka mmle, min-yɔ ka kafɔɔ mintɛ banantii lee fɛ atesaa dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />“Ni afɔ, obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon, tofo teefɔ Yaa nwu, faayɔ okyiini fasumu nwɔ kafɔɔ ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku disibu le niɛyɔ nwu ni ole, diekye SAATE nwu nnyunyuu otu biala kamɛ antofo kafɔɔ otii disibu biala. Nse feewolaa nwɔ yi, fabanyɔɔ; kafɔɔ nse feediɛ nwɔ nnɛɛ, abasĩ fɔ dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Kanunua lolaafanyu, diekye SAATE nwu ntoodiki fɔ alɛ tofo Olekatakɔ fɛ kakleklekɔ. Wɛ osie faabla ɔkpɛ nwu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Ninfɛ di Dawid layɔ olekatakɔ nwu lɛkpata, otofo nini, asaa ntɛkɔ nini, osi nini aba, ayo ya kaamɛ nini ku lɛba le baayɔɔ sikple mankyɛ nii otofo letembi akũ aata obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Aatɔɔ kafɔɔ atembi ya amuu di Ninwuna nwu layɔ aakpee nwɔ ni diisi aata ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ ku ayo ya amuu niɛmana nya eekyi ni aata ni Yaa olekatakɔ kotontɛkɔ ku asaa ya beekleklesa ni ntɛkɔ. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Aatɔɔ afiofa di olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii akudi nwu suoto, ku kasumu ɔkpɛ wɔ omuu bababla ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, diɛkyakaa ni ku awansaa ya amuu babablako ni ɔkpɛ di kasumu kamɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Aabuɛ kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle onutũ wɔ nimawo ninta ni koto sɛɛle awansaa ya amuu babablako ni kasumu ateate sɛkpɛ, ku koto fututu onutũ wɔ nimawo ninta ni koto fututu awansaa ya amuu babablako ni kasumu ateate sɛkpɛ aatɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />Aabuɛ koto sɛɛle onutũ wɔ nimawo ninta ni koto sɛɛle kandiɛ atikasaa ku bakandiɛ ninya ku onutũ nini diata ni kandiɛ ditikasaa biala ku bakandiɛ nini; ku koto fututu onutũ diata ni koto fututu kowesee kandiɛ ditikasaa biala ku bakandiɛ nini, di mmle kanya baablako ni kandiɛ ditikasaa biala ɔkpɛ; <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />koto sɛɛle onutũ diata ni opunu wɔ mantika ni bloblo wɔ beekleklesa ni; koto fututu onutũ diata ni koto fututu sipunu; <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />koto sɛɛle nwaa onutũ diata ni amunikĩisaa, babɛɛsi ku akuuku; koto sɛɛle onutũ diata ni koto sɛɛle lɛkaku biala; koto fututu onutũ diata ni koto fututu lɛkaku biala; <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />ku koto sɛɛle ko baase ni lefoto diata ni olufui oleɔta akyikye. Aatɔɔ kafɔɔ keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni letembi, dile ni koto sɛɛle bakerubim ba ninfukuti ni afoko lɛma kafɔɔ mantĩi ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa.<verse eid="1CH 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Ni di Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “N-ya mmle amuu nle kɔkpana ko niekye ni SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ ko nintika mi ni di suoto nfũ, ni ɛɛtɛɛ lɛsɔnu di ɔkpɛ nwu letembi sisuku simuu suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Dawid lakple aatɔkɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon alɛ, “Wɛ osie ku sɛkambi, faabla kafɔɔ ɔkpɛ nwu. Tan-yɛkɛ ee faata nnɛɛ lafee fɔ, diekye SAATE Yaa nwu, Yaa nii nsiko fɔ. Ɔlɔbadiɛ fɔ ee asĩ fɔ diɛlaase di obe wɔ di ɔkpɛ nwu omuu diɛta ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kasumu nwu leloo nii. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii akudi nwu ntoololaa suoto bɛɛta ɔkpɛ nwu omuu di Yaa olekatakɔ nwu, otii biala kafɔɔ nietuna aye ni kɔnɛɛ kamɛ ɔkpɛ lele kamakyakaako fɔ di ɔkpɛ nwu omuu kamɛ. Banɔɔfotii ku batii nwu bamuu kamakyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ biala kotoko.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Akyɛsaa Diata Ni Olekatakɔ Nwu Otofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Dawid latɔkɔ kasiisakɔ nwu kamuu alɛ: “Obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon, nnwɔ di Yaa lediki nii, okosopo ale adife kafɔɔ di asaa kamɛ nwaa anya. Ɔkpɛ nwu lɛmuɔ, diekye leyo le mmle ninte fɛle lɛkayo diele otii lèle dile, kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lele dile. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Asaa ya ninkpe mi ni amuu ntɔɔyɔ lɛta Yaa nii olekatakɔ nwu ni- koto sɛɛle diɛta ni koto sɛɛle ɔkpɛ, koto fututu diɛta ni koto fututu, abɔɔsaa sɛɛle diɛta ni abɔɔsaa sɛɛle asaa, lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ diɛta ni lɛbɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ, sewoso kafɔɔ diɛta ni sewoso, diɛkyakaa ni ku afuɔ ya bɔɔlɛɛ ni oniks diɛta ni asɔse nwu, afuɔ ya manlɛɛ ni tukuoise, afuɔ ya ku afa atembi ateate, ku afuɔ nwaa ateate amuu ku afuɔwɛkyɛ- n-ya mmle amuu di lɛpɔ kpinwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Nni sɛmaa, di Yaa nii olekatakɔ nwu kobuo mi ni anu nwaa oso yi, kanunua kɔta koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu nkyeko ami omu nii lɛsaawɛ kamɛ nta Yaa nii olekatakɔ, diɛtaka katoo dilenke ni kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala ntɔɔta lɛta ni olekatakɔ klekle ka mmle: <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />koto sɛɛle bakilo nkpe kɔlafa nkpe-nnyɔ (Ofir koto sɛɛle) ku koto fututu beese ni lefoto bakilo nkpe alafa-anyɔ-afosi-atiɛ-nkpe-nnɛ, baayɔ mankakaasa ni di ayo nwu kamɛ seyoyiɛ <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />diata ni koto sɛɛle ɔkpɛ ku koto fututu ɔkpɛ ɔbla, ku ɔkpɛ wɔ omuu di kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ bablatɛ kamabla nii. Kanunua, owe nikotuna alɛ ookleklesa suoto nɔɔ anta SAATE nwu miɛ?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Ninfɛ di ayo kamɛ banɔɔfo, Israel ana banɔɔfotii, di bakpɛtɛ nkpe kanyabayilatɛ, alafa kanyabayilatɛ, ku banɔɔfotii ba niayila ni di ɔka ɔkpɛ kanya latuna baata asaa fãa nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Baata asaa diata ni Yaa olekatakɔ nwu ɔkpɛ ɔbla, koto sɛɛle bakilo nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpe-nnɔɔ ku badarik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">darik ninle Spani batii koto nɛ</char></note> nkpe-lefosi koto futufu bakilo nkpe alafa atiɛ-afosi-atiɛ, abɔɔsaa sɛɛle nkpe alafa akuɔ, ku abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ bakilo mbialɛ ntiɛ-nkpe-alafa-atiɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Otii lele niawɛ ni afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya layɔ nya aata di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kotokatɛkɔ di Gerson otii nwu Yehiel nnɛɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Batii nwu lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di mmle di batunletɛ lɛma nwu latuna nii, diekye baadiki kafutu baata asaa fãa ku otu lɛma omuu baata SAATE nwu. Ɔka Dawid kafɔɔ lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ osie kanya.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Yaa Katansa Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Ni di Dawid latansa SAATE nwu di kasiisakɔ nwu kamuu anu, aabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:10">“Oo SAATE, baatansa fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:10">teewo Israel Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:10">diɛyɔ ni di nua diesifi ni dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="1CH 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Oo SAATE, lele fɔ ninle nimuɔ kplɛ ku osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">ku dibu ku sɛka ole ku sɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">diekye lɛsaa biala di osi ku kasɔ nle fɔ lele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">Oo SAATE, lele fɔ ninle sɛka kalekɔ nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">bɛɛtakatɛ fɔ katoo fɛ disi di asaa amuu suoto.<verse eid="1CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Lɛsaawɛ ku dibu nkye ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">afɔ ninle ɔka di asaa amuu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:12">Nnɛɛ lɛfɔ di osie ku onyɛɛ nsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">alɛ faatakatɛ otii katoo fanta kafɔɔ bamuu osie.<verse eid="1CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Kanunua yi, Yaa loo, buɔpɛ fɔ sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:13">muntansa kafɔɔ dibu lɛfɔ leyooto.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Kafɔɔ owe ninle ami, bawe kafɔɔ ninle batii nii, alɛ buafuo kafutu odiki ɔta asaa fɛ mmle? Lɛsaa biala nkye ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, ni butɔɔta fɔ lɛsaa le lete niekye ni kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Bafɔɔ ku osuku bakyɛntɛ bule di anu lɛfɔ, fɛ mmle di bawa loo bamuu lale nii. Ayi loo kaasɔ suoto nte fɛle kunyii, kunaa ni disitikasaa. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Oo SAATE Yaa loo, asaa ya mmle kpinwu amuu butɔɔta buɔta ni olekatakɔ lɛfɔ otofo ɔta ni Leyooto Klekle lefɔ yi, kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ eekye, amuu ninya kafɔɔ ale fɔ ale. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Yaa nii, n-ye nlɛ fansɔ otu fannyu, ni kuɔkpa fɔ kuobuo fɔ anu kafɔɔ nɛ. Asaa ya mmle amuu ntɔɔta fãa ku disibu biene nɛ. Kanunua ntɔɔnya kafɔɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ mmle di batii lɛfɔ ba ninkpe ni ninfũ lediki kafutu lɛma bɛɛta ni asaa fãa bɛɛta fɔ nii. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Oo SAATE, bate loo Abraham, Isak ku Israel Yaa, ta disibu le mmle disiɛ di batii lɛfɔ situ kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo, faata situ lɛma sile onukawale sita fɔ. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Ta kafɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon otu wɔ niewo ni niimu alɛ aakle sɛlaa lɛfɔ, abiesaa ku sɛsaabla lɛfɔ, aabla kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala alɛ aatofo leyo le ninte ni fɛle lɛkayo le lelolaa suoto lɛta ni.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɔkɔ dikudi nwu nimuu alɛ, “Bitansa SAATE Yaa lee nwu.” Nioso bamuu lɛma latansa SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa nwu; baawa kasɔ, ni baafuusa anu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu ku ɔka anu nɛ.<verse eid="1CH 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baafũ Solomon Fɛ Sɛka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Ni di kaleesɛ baata seleɔta baata SAATE nwu, baata ofiɛ asaaɔta baatɔɔ: banankyue-suɔtɔ kakpe, akunumuu kakpe ku afosobi-suɔtɔ kakpe, diakyakaa ni ku nta asaaɔta lɛma, ku seleɔta bamba kpinwu baata di Israel omuu disi nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Baale, baanyi ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ di SAATE nwu anu di dii nwu nkpo kale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Ninfɛ baafũ Dawid obisuɔtɔbi Solomon fɛ ɔka lɛnyɔɔfa nɛ. Baapɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ di SAATE nwu anu alɛ ale ɔka, di Sadok kafɔɔ ale oletatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Nioso Solomon lasiɛ di SAATE nwu lɛkakpomii suoto fɛ ɔka di ote Dawid kanya. Asaa lalɛ nwɔ ɔkyɛ, Israel omuu kafɔɔ lanu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Banɔɔfotii bamuu ku basuɔtɔ sientɛ bamuu, diakyakaa ni di Ɔka Dawid babisuɔtɔbi bamuu, laka ntam baawakosa suoto kasɔ baata Ɔka Solomon.<verse eid="1CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />SAATE nwu latakatɛsa Solomon katoo osie kanya di Israel omuu anu, ni aaklɛɛ nwɔ sɛka kanya di ɔka kuonwii di Israel suoto diiwɛ ni didii.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Sɛka Ole Di Obe Kakuu Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Yese obisuɔtɔbi Dawid lale sɛka di Israel omuu suoto. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Aale sɛka di Israel suoto alɛɛ afosi-ana, alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ di Hebron, alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-alɛɛ-atiɛ kafɔɔ di Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Aakpi di obe wɔ aatɛ aabe ni nwaa, aale nkpa aaklɛsa, aawɛ lɛsaawɛ ku dibu. Obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon niayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka.<verse eid="1CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Ɔka Dawid sɛka olebee sɛsaabla nnya, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaadu ni kayɛntɛkɔ yi, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di asaanyatɛ Samuel akũ kamɛ, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan akũ kamɛ ku asaanyatɛ Gad akũ kamɛ, <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />diakyakaa ni di sɛka olebee nɔɔ asaa ya aabla ni ku osie, ku anyasaa ya niamana nwɔ aakyi ni ku Israel ku sɛka nlekɔ be di nsɔ bamba mmuu suoto.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>